Package: FunMel
Title: Colour-Calibrated Quantification of Fungal Melanization in
        Confrontation Assays
Version: 0.4.4
Authors@R: 
    person("Mitra", "Ghotbi", email = "mitra.ghotbi@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9185-9993"))
Description: Layout-based analysis of plate photographs for measuring fungal
    colony colour, shape and edge-to-centre profiles, developed for four
    approximately round 'Zymoseptoria tritici' colonies and a central partner.
    Retains the image workflow originally developed as 'MycoHalo'. Explicit
    metadata matches every treatment set to its own control plates. Calculates
    descriptive treatment-to-control image-darkness ratios and assesses matched
    treatment differences using plate-level random effects with 'lme4' and
    Satterthwaite contrasts from 'lmerTest'. Exports quality-control figures,
    measurements, matched coefficients and diagnostic information. Image darkness
    is a proxy requiring biological validation, not a pigment concentration.
